# Scouting Memories: track ONLY our own code.
#
# Everything else in the WordPress install (core, third-party plugins and themes, uploads,
# caches, WP Engine files) lives on the server and is managed there, not in Git. WP Engine
# only removes files from the live site that were removed from this repository, so files
# that were never tracked here are left alone on the server.
#
# To start tracking a new plugin or theme of our own, add a "!" line for it below.

# Ignore everything at the top level...
/*
!/.gitignore

# ...except our tests
!/tests/

# ...the AI Tagging Assistant that runs on the development server (never published to
# WP Engine). Inside it, ONLY the listed files and folders: anything else (state,
# cache, keys, settings files) stays out of a public repository.
!/tagger-service/
/tagger-service/*
!/tagger-service/.gitattributes
!/tagger-service/README.md
!/tagger-service/tagger_service.py
!/tagger-service/scouting-tagger.service
!/tagger-service/skills/
/tagger-service/skills/*
!/tagger-service/skills/*.md
!/tagger-service/static/
/tagger-service/static/*
!/tagger-service/static/app.html
!/tagger-service/static/settings.html
!/tagger-service/static/app.js

# ...and wp-content, where only our folders are allowed
!/wp-content/
/wp-content/*

!/wp-content/plugins/
/wp-content/plugins/*
!/wp-content/plugins/scouting-pdf-embedder/
!/wp-content/plugins/scouting-ai-tagger/

!/wp-content/mu-plugins/
/wp-content/mu-plugins/*
!/wp-content/mu-plugins/scouting-pdf-loader.php

!/wp-content/themes/
/wp-content/themes/*
!/wp-content/themes/scoutingmemories/

# Never commit, even inside our folders
node_modules/
test-results/
playwright-report/
.env
.env.*
*.env
.ssh/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.sqlite3
*.pem
*.key
*.bak

# Starter-theme documents we never deploy
/wp-content/themes/*/README.md
/wp-content/themes/*/LICENSE
